<title>ETHIOPIA: Ethiopian birr weakens against the dollar.</title>
<headline>Ethiopian birr weakens against the dollar.</headline>
<dateline>ADDIS ABABA 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ethiopian birr weakend against the dollar on Monday, the central National Bank of Ethiopia (NBE) said.</p>
<p>It posted the birr at a mean rate of 6.6770 against the dollar compared to 6.6350 last week.</p>
<p>The central bank quoted the birr at a mean rate of 10.7366 against the pound from 10.7102 last week while against the yen, the birr traded at 0.055099 from 0.054681.</p>
</text>
